,"target":296},"https://www.geonames.org/2523119/sicilia.html",{"geo":298,"precision":299},"37.75,14.25",{"match":300,"n":301},"preceding-sibling::geo","170000",{"layout":303},{"p":304,"rs":305,"damage":46},"Five lines of Greek letters, centred on the stone",{"_":51,"ana":52,"ref":53},{"lettering":307,"dimensions":308},"Slightly crudely incised simple broad letters without serifs. Nu i sregular; epsilon has slightly shorter middle bar; mu has slightly inward leaning first and last strokes, the mid-strokes reach down to the base-line; rho has a small eye, not always fully closed; alpha has broken bar; omega varies between open circle closed by horizontal bar and closed ovoid form with horizontal bar; phi has a small circular eye; sigma has standard form with horizontal top and bottom storkes; omicron is approximately the same size as other letters.",[309,314],{"type":58,"l":310,"from":60,"to":311,"h":312,"unit":62,"atLeast":63,"atMost":313},"Lines 1-5","line5","30-45","45",{"type":66,"l":67,"from":60,"to":68,"unit":62},{"_":316,"notBefore":317,"notAfter":73},"2nd century BCE(?)",-200,[319,320],{"_":76,"type":77,"ref":78,"region":79},{"_":81,"type":82,"ref":83,"offset":84,"region":79},[322],[87,88],[90,91],{"_":95,"role":96,"ref":97},{"_":326,"type":100},"8706",{"_":102,"mainLang":103,"languages":328},[102],{"n":185,"url":330,"height":331,"width":332,"desc":333,"surfaceType":190},"ISic001207_tiled.tif","3212px","2498px","Photo J. Prag, courtesy Museo Archeologico Regionale Antonino Salinas",[335],{"atLeast":107,"atMost":336},45,[110,111,112,113,338,339,114],"Manni Piraino, 1976, Contribution Épigraphique à l'Étude de l'esclavage en Sicile","Manganaro, 1988, La Sicilia da Sesto Pompeo a Diocleziano",[116,117,118,119,341,342,120],"R9M263EA","RZSFKACR",[344,345,346,32,36,347,125,126,127,128,129,130,131,103],"isic001207","epitaph for nemeris, a goldsmith",{"_":12},"grey sandstone , likely cod (identification based on pxrf, digital microscopy, xrd, optical microscopy)","\u